-- NORM-LOG N10 goal A: SEESAW's P3b, with the party-qualified read.
-- Pass: BREACHED in both orders (b decides at its arming, at 0, before P's act at 4). Before A, a RAND b was FULFILLED.
IMPORT prelude
DECLARE Who IS ONE OF P, Q
DECLARE Act IS ONE OF x, y
GIVETH DEONTIC Who Act
a MEANS PARTY P MUST x WITHIN 5 HENCE RECORD `waived` IS TRUE HENCE FULFILLED
GIVETH DEONTIC Who Act
b MEANS IF RECALL P's `waived` EQUALS NOTHING THEN PARTY Q MUST y WITHIN 3 ELSE FULFILLED
#TRACE a RAND b AT 0 WITH PARTY P DOES x AT 4
#TRACE b RAND a AT 0 WITH PARTY P DOES x AT 4
